---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About Prodory | AO Plus Solutions" description="Prodory is the cloud-native infrastructure and platform engineering practice of AO Plus Solutions Pvt Ltd, Dombivli, Maharashtra." path="/about/">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">About Prodory</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-[#4B5563]">Prodory is the cloud-native infrastructure, Kubernetes and platform engineering practice of {SITE.parent}, founded in {SITE.founded} and based in Dombivli, Maharashtra, India.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">How we work</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 grid list-disc gap-3 pl-5 text-[#4B5563]">
      <li>Everything we build is code in repositories your organisation owns.</li>
      <li>We hand over documentation and runbooks, and train the team that will run the platform.</li>
      <li>We state what we can and cannot verify. Where a result depends on your environment, we say so before you commit.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Company registrations</h2>
    <dl class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Legal entity</dt><dd>{SITE.parent}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">CIN</dt><dd class="font-mono">{SITE.cin}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Startup recognition</dt><dd>{SITE.dpiit}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">UDYAM</dt><dd class="font-mono">{SITE.udyam}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">GSTIN</dt><dd class="font-mono">{SITE.gstin}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">PAN</dt><dd class="font-mono">{SITE.pan}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Services code (SAC)</dt><dd>{SITE.sac}, GST {SITE.gstRate}</dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Head office</dt><dd>{SITE.head.line1}, {SITE.head.line2}, {SITE.head.line3}</dd>
    </dl>
    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold">Leadership</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-[#4B5563]">Bejoyata Singh, Founder and Director, AO Plus Solutions. Prodory team profiles are being prepared and will be published once each person has approved their profile.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
